|change = Surge potions can now be stored in [[Tiny storage unit|storage units]] within the [[Chambers of Xeric]].
}}
{{Subject changes
|date = 29 May 2025
|update = Yama CAs & More!
|change = Surge potion now has a 6-tick delay when used in PVP areas. The special attack energy will not restore if a player has moved more than 15 tiles away. Additionally, the potion cannot be used if you're already at 100% special attack energy.
}}
{{Subject changes footer}}

==Mechanics==
[[File:Drinking surge potion.gif|frame|A player drinks a dose of surge potion.]]
Surge potions restore 25% [[special attack]] energy per dose, but can only be drunk once every five minutes. Attempting to drink another dose before the cooldown expires results in a game message stating {{mes|You are still full of adrenaline. You'll be able to drink in [time remaining].}} When the cooldown expires, a game message will appear stating {{mes|You now feel capable of drinking another dose of surge potion.|colour=#ff3045}}

